    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.Manager_Email }}",
        "subject": "Permohonan Cuti",
        "message": "=<p>Yth. Manager,</p>\n\n<p>\n    Terdapat pengajuan cuti baru dari karyawan yang memerlukan persetujuan Anda.\n    Berikut adalah detail pengajuannya:\n</p>\n\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 600px; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\">\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Nama Karyawan</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.Nama_Lengkap }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Email</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Email Karyawan'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Jenis Cuti</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Jenis Cuti'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Tanggal Cuti</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">\n            {{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Tanggal Mulai'] }}\n            s.d.\n            {{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Tanggal Selesai'] }}\n        </td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Durasi</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.durationRequested }} hari</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd; background-color: #f5f5f5;\"><strong>Alasan</strong></td>\n        <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Alasan/Keterangan'] }}</td>\n    </tr>\n</table>\n\n<p style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><strong>Keputusan Persetujuan</strong></p>\n\n<p>Silakan tinjau pengajuan dan pilih salah satu keputusan berikut:</p>\n\n<p style=\"margin: 25px 0;\">\n    <a href=\"https://n8n-2az3avq6wip6.jkt5.sumopod.my.id/webhook-test/approval-handler?status=approved&amp;email={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Email Karyawan'] }}&amp;days={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.durationRequested }}&amp;id={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.requestId }}\"\n       style=\"background-color: #198754; color: white; padding: 12px 22px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n        ✓ SETUJUI\n    </a>\n    &nbsp;&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"https://n8n-2az3avq6wip6.jkt5.sumopod.my.id/webhook-test/approval-handler?status=rejected&amp;email={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json['Email Karyawan'] }}&amp;days={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.durationRequested }}&amp;id={{ $('Validasi Cuti').first().json.requestId }}\"\n       style=\"background-color: #dc3545; color: white; padding: 12px 22px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">\n        ✕ TOLAK\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 12px;\">\n    Email ini dikirim secara otomatis oleh sistem pengajuan cuti karyawan.\n    Mohon tidak membalas email ini.\n</p>\n\n<p>Salam,<br><strong>HR System</strong></p>\n",
